{"n": 21, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "21.webp", "text": "BMW MAINTENANCE SYSTEM\n00 00 245 BMW Annual Check\n\nImportant! :\n\nService Indicator (SI) must be reset atier annual check display\n(INSPECTION):\n\nSwitch off all electrical equipment.\n\nTurn on ignition - do not run\n\nUse SI-R* with adapter” for large (20-pin) diagnosis socket and\nplug In diagnosis socket.\n\nPush in and hold recessed, red INSPECTION button - green\nlamp (function control) comes on.\n\nRed lamp also comes on atter approx. 3 sec. and goes out after\napprox. 12 seconds.\n\nRelease INSPECTION button - green lamp goes out.\n\nGradual Introduction of a new Si display with clock symbol and\nonly one red diode light since January, 1986. This clock symbol\nlights up together with the INSPECTION sign for a time depend-\nent inspection and has no Influence on the green diode lights.\nResetting must be repeated after 10 seconds when load and\nlime dependent Inspections occur together (clock symbol and\nyellow or red diode light come on), In order to cancel the clock\nsymbol and INSPECTION sign, and reactivate the green diode\nlights.\n\nChecking Service Indicator (S!):\n\nThe number of lighted green diode lights Is not changed by\nresetting a time dependent Inspection, but the INSPECTION\nsign and clock symbol must go out.\n\n* SIR = Service Indicator Resetter, Order No. 62 1 100.\n“* Adapter, Order No. 62 1 140.\n\nOrder No. of new SI-R = 621\nOrder No. of adapter for new SI-R = 62 1", "words": [["BMW", 0.0932, 0.122, 0.1175, 0.1326], ["MAINTENANCE", 0.1206, 0.122, 0.1966, 0.1333], ["SYSTEM", 0.2006, 0.122, 0.2432, 0.134], ["00", 0.0922, 0.1525, 0.1039, 0.1631], ["00", 0.1064, 0.1525, 0.118, 0.1631], ["245", 0.1211, 0.1525, 0.1378, 0.1631], ["BMW", 0.1499, 0.1505, 0.1758, 0.1631], ["Annual", 0.1793, 0.1525, 0.2148, 0.1638], ["Check", 0.2178, 0.1525, 0.2487, 0.1638], ["Important!", 0.0932, 0.1824, 0.1388, 0.2069], [":", 0.2796, 0.2016, 0.2817, 0.2042], ["Service", 0.0907, 0.2003, 0.1261, 0.2208]